5. THE `contracts/` DIRECTORY IS EXCLUDED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything in the `contracts/` directory is public domain under CC0 1.0 and is NOT
subject to this licence. See `contracts/LICENSE`.

Those files are data contracts originating from Chronicle.Portfolio.App, which released
them under CC0 precisely so that a renderer such as this one could copy them, generate
types from them, embed them and ship commercially without asking. They are reproduced
here under that dedication and remain under it.

The carve-out is limited to the format. It grants no rights over this software, which
consumes that format, and it is the ONLY thing this repository shares with Chronicle.
No Chronicle source code is present here, and none may be added.

